[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the steering wheel in\nthe centred position with the wheels straight.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p>1. Loosen the band fixing the steering column switch unit.</p><p>2. Move the steering column switch unit slightly and disconnect\nthe electrical connections (2a, 2b, 2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Clock spring coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023983\">D47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024115\">H5A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024117\">H5C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2d</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024116\">H5B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Recover the stalk unit with the clock spring</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005026.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>If necessary, <a href=\"#/3025609\">5580C12</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Closely observe the safety regulations\nestablished for this operation.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the steering column\nswitch unit is not damaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical\ntest on it.</p><p>Check that the wheels are straight (not\nsteered)</p><p>If the clock spring is removed, <a href=\"#/3025609\">5580C12</a></p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p><p>Refit the stalk unit with clock spring</p><p>Tighten the band fixing the steering column\nswitch unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check the operation of the systems involved\n(lights, wipers, horns).</p>"],[31,63,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the steering wheel in the centred\nposition with the wheels straight.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p>1. Loosen the band fixing the steering column switch unit.</p><p>2. Move the steering column switch unit slightly and disconnect\nthe electrical connections (2a, 2b, 2c, 2d, 2e).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Clock spring coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023983\">D47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024115\">H5A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024117\">H5C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2d</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H5D</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2e</p></td><td><p>Steering sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024286\">K58</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Keep the steering column switch unit and clock spring (3a).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The steering angle sensor (3b)\ncannot be separated from the steering column switch unit.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048873.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,16384,"<p>If necessary, <a href=\"#/3025609\">5580C12</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Closely observe the safety regulations\nestablished for this operation.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the steering column switch unit\nis not damaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical test on\nit.</p><p>Check that the wheels are straight (not\nsteered)</p><p>If the clock spring is removed, <a href=\"#/3025609\">5580C12</a></p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p><p>Refit the stalk unit with clock spring</p><p>Tighten the band fixing the steering column\nswitch unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check the operation of the systems involved\n(lights, wipers, horns).</p>"]]